# Load the saved game from the memory card: in-game control in Jijimon's house (screen 218)
# in about 90 seconds, on any disc (original or compiled), because a memory card save
# only holds game data, not code.
# Usage: tools/dev/emulator.py start DISC.cue --card build/states/file-city.mcd
#        tools/dev/emulator.py seq tools/dev/sequences/continue.seq
wait 45, START 20, wait 6, START 20, wait 6
# CONTINUE GAME -> slot 1 on the card -> game 1 -> "Continue adventure?" Yes
DOWN 8, wait 1, CROSS 10, wait 5, CROSS 10, wait 5, CROSS 10, wait 4, CROSS 10, wait 12
